      "question": "Is a house viewing the same as a home inspection?",
      "answer": "No, an initial house viewing is simply your first walkthrough to determine whether you want to purchase the property. A professional inspection is performed by a licensed home inspector after your purchase offer is accepted under an inspection contingency. You can review the inspector's detailed testing process on our [home inspection checklist](/checklists/home-inspection-checklist/)."
